{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>貴為潮流核心的澀谷街頭，除了一逛再逛的百貨商場，那些低調不張揚的木門背後盡是臥虎藏龍的壽司店。由百名店江戶前Omakase，到上班族大推的平價立食，溫熱赤酢醋飯配上當季鮮魚，每一口都是幸福！今次為大家精選10間澀谷Tabelog高分壽司名店，奢華料理、高CP值之選統統有齊～</p><p>🩵留言「sushi」Send澀谷精選壽司店list &amp; 預約連結給你～</p><p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179257683690455339_12166719476ad88d45804c5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179257683820735757_9370261736ad88d4651f04.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179257683905565637_6840175346ad88d473d4ec.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179257683996683972_7013921366ad88d489628b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179257684127783372_8930301466ad88d4964170.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179257684207099663_4335972936ad88d4a2e41f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179257684294841606_14502926106ad88d4b3ba0b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p><p>Tags : IG精選 澀谷壽司 澀谷美食 為食榜</p><p>圖片來源：@tabelog_japanbylocals / 官方 資料或影片來源： Gotrip IG</p><p>Oct 21 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:20:07.385953+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":415,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:00:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:38:22.191879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:39.679468+00:00","content_hash":"4021fbf018b5db